id: smoke-bomb
name: Smoke Bomb
kind: gear
craftDC: Apprentice
# "You may spend 1 Action to throw the Smoke Bomb."
placeCost: 1
# "In this AoE, all Squares gain the Obscured Environmental Quality until the end of your
# next turn." The Smoked mark, on everyone in it, to the end of the thrower's next turn.
areaMark: smoked
areaUntil: end
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Thrown for an Action: everyone in the Sphere it bursts in is in Obscured Squares until the
  end of your next turn.
text: >
  Smoke Bomb: A mixture of black powder and chemicals set to ignite upon physical impact, this
  object creates a thick black cloud of smoke when used.
  –Craft DC: Apprentice
  –Effects: You may spend 1 Action to throw the Smoke Bomb at any Square within a Destructive
  Sphere AoE (centered on you). Create a Destructive Sphere AoE centered on your chosen
  Square. In this AoE, all Squares gain the Obscured Environmental Quality until the end of
  your next turn.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Throw: 1 Action, and everyone targeted - the ones the Sphere covers - gains the Smoked mark
# until the end of the thrower's next turn. While they hold it their Square is Obscured, the
# way Elemental (Fire)'s Ignited makes one Aflame. The thrower too, if they are in it and
# target themselves.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Which Square, and who the Sphere covers. There are no Squares here, so a Square with nobody
# in it has nothing to carry the smoke - it is Obscured at the table, and nothing here needs
# to know. Whether the Smoke Bomb is used up the entry does not say, and it stays.
